  2) Swing high 3-15 sessions back, then a 2-10 day pullback with
     JMA(13,40,2) falling on >= 2 days and not rising the day before
  3) Pullback low within 0.5% of the higher of EMA21 / SMA50 (or below)
  4) Pullback >= 1.5 ATR14 deep; no close > 3% under SMA50, no low under SMA150
  5) Signal day: green, body >= 0.4 ATR (Strong >= 0.6 ATR, else Moderate),
     closes back above the JMA and EMA21
  OUTPUT: Entry = signal day close, Stop = pullback low,
          Target 1 = swing high, Target 2 = entry + 2R
